            <strong>Where gas still wins: sustained runtime and backpack output.</strong> If your cleanup runs for hours, a fuel can beats any battery, and the very high output backpack units above 900 CFM have no cordless equivalent. On acreage with a heavy leaf drop, gas remains the right answer.
          </p>

